From ua5e83218c834e013 at groups.google.com  Sat Apr  6 16:14:10 2013
From: ua5e83218c834e013 at groups.google.com (Michael Betancourt)
Date: Sat, 06 Apr 2013 16:14:10 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-users] is this paper at related to the No U-Turn concept in NUTS
