Subject: Re: [stan-users] calculation of Poisson log-likelihood from STAN does match dpois in R
Message-ID: <ron4MD8ln5s.WrRylHPxIj4J@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <ron4MD8ln5s.4mUvfBjG8TsJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <ron4MD8ln5s.4mUvfBjG8TsJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
