Subject: bug in inv_cloglog formula
Message-ID: <mEKx971vwBM.bJ_yXe5r5wkJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/mEKx971vwBM/m/bJ_yXe5r5wkJ>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The formula for inv_cloglog is wrong.  It should be:

   inv_cloglog(y) =  1 - exp(-exp(y))

   cloglog(x) = log(-log(1 - x))

I'm going to fix that and also include cloglog
for the next release.

- Bob

