On Thu, Apr 18, 2013 at 4:18 PM, Bill Harris <bill_...@facilitatedsystems.com> wrote:
> The last line of the output from library(rstan) together with the output of stan_version() confuse me.  Is it possible that stan_version() didn't get updated, or is it possible that I have a borked installation?

I think you have just have a broken version of rstan.  This happens on windows and that why in the rstan getting started, we have remove rstan before installing a new version of rstan, and then restart R.  So make sure you have removed an older version of rstan while rstan is not loaded before installing a new one.

--
Jiqiang

